  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"Each book in the I Ching series will be a visual meditation on one of the sixty-four entries in the Chinese wisdom book known as the Book of Change. When doing a reading from the I Ching, the reader makes a randomized selection of two symbols called trigrams. There are eight trigrams to select from, meaning that there is a total of sixty-four combinations--or 'hexagrams'--that may result." --Author's statement.</subfield>
